[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169712329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118068#issuecomment-4169712329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118068","id":4169712329,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74iMLJ","user":{"login":"gtmacdonald","id":3230260,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzAyNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3230260?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald","html_url":"https://github.com/gtmacdonald","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtmacdonald/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T12:22:55Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T12:22:55Z","body":"Closing this — after investigating how godot-cpp handles the same ptrcall path, the extra reference from `PtrToArg<Ref<T>>::encode` is **intentional**. godot-cpp's `_gde_internal_constructor` absorbs it by setting the pointer without calling `reference()`, and the `Ref<T>` destructor later balances it with `unreference()`.\n\nThe bug is in godot-zig (and likely godot-rust/gdext#108) — the binding reads the raw pointer without accounting for the owned reference that `encode` transfers. The fix belongs in the binding, not the engine.\n\nSorry for the noise!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4169712329/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]